H to O2 to produce the superoxide anion (O2(-)) (PubMed:1660188). Activates PLCG2 (PubMed:19394299)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}